        <type>fmt::color</type>
        <definition>static fmt::color Banner::get_random_color</definition>
        <argsstring>()</argsstring>
        <name>get_random_color</name>
        <qualifiedname>Banner::get_random_color</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Picks a random colour for the ASCII logo. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The palette is initialised once as a function-local static. A hardware random_device seeds a fresh mt19937 on each call, and a static uniform distribution selects an index in [0, colors.size() - 1]. <simplesect kind="return"><para>One of the palette colours. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>The returned colour is decorative; no significance should be attached to it. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>The shared static distribution is not locked, but this function is called only once during startup, so there is no concurrent invocation in this server. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
