    <briefdescription>
<para>Stateless collection of static helpers for stdout startup output. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All functions are static and use fmt for coloured output. There are no members and no instances are required; the class only groups related printing utilities. Shared static data is confined to the local statics in <ref refid="classBanner_1a0f4d8408fd489c69079a28a1b2b9648f" kindref="member">get_random_color()</ref> and the cached logo string. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
